# The determinism hash in the smoke test is computed over raw file bytes of
# the config and the sample data. Pin line endings and binary-ness so a
# checkout on any OS reproduces the same bytes, and therefore the same hash.
*.qnts binary
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
